---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro'
import DrawApp from '../components/DrawApp.vue'
---
<SiteLayout
  title="开始占卜｜莫里i的塔罗札记"
  description="选择一个牌阵，随机抽牌，或录入你现实中抽到的牌，得到一份结构化的塔罗参考解读。"
>
  <section class="page-intro section-shell narrow-shell">
    <p class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-line"></span>今日的牌面</p>
    <h1>让问题有一个<br /><em>可以凝视的形状。</em></h1>
    <p>先选一个牌阵和主题。你可以让牌替你随机出现，也可以把现实中已经抽到的牌录进来。</p>
  </section>
  <section class="section-shell app-shell">
    <DrawApp client:load />
  </section>
</SiteLayout>
